## Develop

```bash
npm install
npm run dev      # rebuilds dist/ on every change
npm start        # runs the game with this {{kindLabel}} loaded (restarts on changes)
```

{{devNotes}}

- `src/index.ts` is the code that runs in the game: `activate(api, info)` receives the object the
  game passes to `mods.loadAll(api)`.
- `overrides/` holds files that replace or add the game's own files, at the same path as in the
  game's build (`overrides/assets/backgrounds/park.png` replaces `assets/backgrounds/park.png`).
- `cover.png` is the image the game shows for this {{kindLabel}}: replace the placeholder.

